<title>UK: Commerzbank unit sets A$100 mln December 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank unit sets A$100 mln December 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK OVERSEAS FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    17.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.845   PAY DATE  S-19.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
